fixture jump_ceiling_bump
doc Control for the ceiling-corner nudge: overlapping the corner by 7 u (over 6) bumps the head
room test/lip
spawn 605 544
frames 40
input
  0..30 jump
end
expect
  never 0..39 nudge_x!=0
  mark bump 1..20 hit_ceiling=1
  # The head stops at the block's bottom (416): feet at 460.
  at bump y=460u x=605u
end
